Given the following premises and a conclusion, determine whether the conclusion logically follows from the premises.

Premises:
- forall x (Book(x) -> Contains(x, knowledge))
- Metal(Gold).
- forall x forall y (ReadBook(x, y) -> Gains(x, knowledge))
- ReadBook(harry, walden) AND Book(walden)
- forall x (Gains(x, knowledge) -> Smarter(x))

